  "description": "Electrify your ride with awesome performance, and 9 speeds powered by a 200W/36Vmid-motor and 36V/9.5AH battery. Folding convenience is perfectly complemented with a hidden seatpost battery and an ultra-light drive system. Enjoy long range without sacrificing weight and appearance. The DELTECH cable boosts frame strength and stiffness for safety and efficient pedaling even against big-wheelers.\n\nUnio E20: The All-Rounder\n\nThe Unio E20 is a lightweight, high-performance folding electric bicycle, perfect for both leisure rides and daily commuting. Enjoy versatility and convenience in one sleek package.\n\nCustomize Your Ride\n\nFeatures an adjustable handlepost and handlebar, allowing for personalized height and angle settings. This ensures comfort and adaptability for riders of all sizes, enhancing the overall riding experience.\n\nSmart LCD Display\n\nThe Unio E20's LCD display offers 5 levels of electric assist, showcasing speed, mileage, and battery status in real time. Just tap and pedal to activate the motor assist, making it easy to fold and unfold for compact storage.\n\nBA Hinge: Secure your ride\n\nReinforced and reliable four-link structure, precision forged aluminum. Locks tight, with effortlessly quick folding and unfolding. Forged for enhanced strength and stunning design.\n\nMid-mount torque motor\n\nCompact and light, yet super powerful for its size, perfectly balanced for various road conditions including uphill ascents, while maintaining a quiet drive.\n\nDahon Unio E20, First Class Mid-drive Motor eBike\n\nQuality, Comfort, Performance All-in-One\n\nSeamless Concealed Seatpost Battery\n\nThe Unio E20's concealed seatpost battery integrates smoothly with the frame, offering easy removal for charging. Featuring 12 patented safety measures, it ensures optimal protection against overcharging, overheating, and short circuits while enhancing convenience and durability.",
